  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Rumor Cage, Zhou Xiong Xin of Heavenly Court activates the immortal killer move Rumors Become Tigers together with Malicious Rumors. Silver characters blaze, dense silvery light flows and swirls, and silver tigers emerge from that light to attack Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        1700
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_rumor_cage",
        "char_zhou_xiong_xin",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "move_malicious_rumors",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan finds the tigers endless and one with the Rumor Cage battlefield: killed tigers fade into silver light and regenerate no matter how many fall. They also grow stronger quickly, becoming tougher and more agile until even Spring Scissors, which first cut them like thin paper, starts to miss. He reads the method as information path unified with human path, drawing on the grudge of Central Continent’s mortals, similar to people’s accusation. Zhou Xiong Xin confirms that the move was created by Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable and uses the will of Central Continent’s people.",
      "chapters": [
        1700
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "silver-tigers",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_spring_scissors",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_primordial_origin_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With that advantage he expects his battle strength to keep growing until attrition kills Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        1701
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "silver-tigers",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Hairy Foot Mountain, Zhou Xiong Xin uses the information path killer move Rumors Become Tigers so that tigers form into groups and attack Wu Yong. Inside a later Rumor Cage, human path Peerless is used; Chi Qu You is then devoured by information path tigers.",
      "chapters": [
        1932
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "repelling-wu-yong",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hairy_foot_mountain",
        "char_wu_yong",
        "move_peerless",
        "char_chi_qu_you"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On Heavenly Court’s battlefield he again sends rumors become tigers roaring at Wu Yong like a group of tigers.",
      "chapters": [
        1948
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-battlefield",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Zhan Bu Du charges Book Mountain, Zhou Xiong Xin casts Rumors Become Tigers once more; Zhan Bu Du absorbs the tigers into his stomach and kills Zhou Xiong Xin on the spot.",
      "chapters": [
        2182
      ],
